\paragraph{Communication} The protocol is one-shot in the sense
of  . No intermediate training artifact is ever exposed. It is not
silent. Key generation precedes it, selection costs at most $2\Nc\Cc$ encrypted comparisons, once, and serving
costs traffic per query.
