Accuracy on the global test set, three seeds, $\Nc=10$, $\alpha=0.1$.
The servable columns are the two arrangements the protocol answers queries from.
The reference columns are not servable under the threat model of
 . The estimator selects per seed, so the selected accuracy is
$0.669$ on AG-News, $0.756$ on CIFAR-100, and the bolded value
elsewhere. We did not run the pooled reference on CIFAR-100. On one seed
the Dirichlet draw assigns fewer than twenty samples to some clients, which cannot
