# paragraph differs from the submission's and needs its own entry.
We build on CKKS~\cite{cheon2017ckks}, which performs approximate arithmetic on
packed vectors of real numbers under encryption. It is
levelled~\cite{lyubashevsky2010ideal}, so each multiplication spends one
level of a finite budget, and a depleted budget is restored by
bootstrapping~\cite{cheon2018bootstrapping}.
